## Environment Variables

```
# .env.local — required, never commit this file
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxx.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ...
```

Access in code via `process.env.EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`.
All client-side env vars must be prefixed `EXPO_PUBLIC_`.

