## Design System

All design tokens live in `constants/colors.ts`. Always import from there — never hardcode hex values.

### Colors
```ts
COLORS.background     // #F7F2E8  warm parchment — main bg
COLORS.surface        // #EDE8DF  slightly darker — cards, inputs
COLORS.surfaceRaised  // #E5DFD4  modals, elevated cards
COLORS.primary        // #2D5A41  forest green — buttons, active states, CTAs
COLORS.accent         // #C9892B  warm gold — stars, XP, streaks
COLORS.text           // #1C1612  near-black warm — primary text
COLORS.textSecondary  // #6B5D4F  medium warm brown
COLORS.textMuted      // #9B8B7A  placeholders, captions
COLORS.border         // #D4C5B2  dividers, input borders
COLORS.borderLight    // #E0D8CE  subtle separators
```

### Spacing
```ts
SPACING.xs    // 4
SPACING.sm    // 8
SPACING.md    // 16
SPACING.lg    // 24
SPACING.xl    // 32
SPACING.page  // 18 — standard horizontal screen padding
```

### Border Radius
```ts
RADIUS.sm    // 8
RADIUS.md    // 12
RADIUS.lg    // 16
RADIUS.xl    // 20
RADIUS.full  // 999 — pills, avatars
```

### Typography
- Body/UI: system font
- Headings / book titles / screen titles: `fontFamily: 'Georgia'` — gives the literary feel
- Screen titles are typically `fontSize: 26, fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontWeight: '500'`

